Summary of ThroughNet modifications
================================================================================

(Tracked in detail in CORRECTIONS.md.)

- Rebuilt the ESP32-S3 node firmware with the display compiled out, fixing a
  zero-CSI (yield=0pps) failure on headless ESP32-S3 DevKitC boards, where the
  shipped binaries stayed in MGMT-only promiscuous mode and never produced CSI.
- Corrected the firmware build toolchain from ESP-IDF v5.2 (as documented
  upstream, which fails on the current source) to v5.4.
- Added a display-off build config fragment (firmware/esp32-csi-node/
  sdkconfig.nodisp) and retained a working prebuilt binary set under
  firmware/esp32-csi-node/release_bins/throughnet-s3-nodisp/.
- Added CORRECTIONS.md documenting upstream bugs and doc gaps discovered.

This is an evolving fork; further changes are ongoing.
